  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n79 – [6 – {4 – (8 × (6 + 3))}] ÷ 2\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a834a6610a3906ce7c10001febd31ebebe7a7d07ebdf92a1aafa436d3b3ff8f3.png] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 79 – [6 – {4 – (8 × (6 + 3))}] ÷ 2\n\n⇒ 79 – [6 – {4 – (8 × (9))}] ÷ 2\n\n⇒ 79 – [6 – {4 – (72)}] ÷ 2\n\n⇒ 79 – [6 – {- 68))}] ÷ 2\n\n⇒ 79 - [6 + 68] ÷ 2\n\n⇒ 79 - 74 ÷ 2\n\n⇒ 79 - 37\n\n⇒ 42\n\n**∴ The Required simplified value is 42.**",
